# cache directories for static analysis tools
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# .sounding/ is PRIVATE (GUA-168). This is a PUBLIC repo and the tree is a journal
# about a real person. Default-deny: everything under it is ignored, so a new personal
# file is never one `git add -A` from being published. Do not invert this.
# Must stay `.sounding/**`, not `.sounding/`: git cannot re-include a file whose parent
# directory is excluded, so `.sounding/` silently disables every `!` line below.
.sounding/**

# Transferable state -- carries the system, not the person. Re-allowed explicitly.
# (gitignore has no trailing comments: text after a pattern is part of the pattern.)
# Cross-repo pointer; must survive clone for mobile /meta-wake.
!.sounding/queue.md
# Mobile mirror of ~/.claude/refs (stack conventions).
!.sounding/refs/
!.sounding/refs/**
# dashboard moved to docs/dashboard.html (GUA-164); no longer in .sounding/
